<p>Hi <%= @member.name %>,</p>

<p>A new round of WE Match is open in <strong><%= @group.name %></strong>, and we'd love you to take part.</p>

<p>Women Emerging brings women together so they can support one another and learn from each other — across generations, specialisms, and parts of the world. This round is a simple way to do that: one conversation with someone in your group.</p>

<p>Your link below is personal to you. Please don't forward it.</p>

<p>It takes about a minute. You'll choose:</p>
<ul>
  <li>A topic you'd like to explore</li>
  <li>One or two 1-hour windows in the week of <%= @meeting_week.first.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %>, shown in your own time zone</li>
</ul>

<p>
  <a href="<%= @response_url %>">Share your availability</a>
</p>

<% if @closes_at.present? %>
  <p>Please respond by <%= @closes_at.strftime("%A, %B %-d, %Y, %H:%M UTC") %>.</p>
<% end %>

<p>We'll introduce you to someone in your group who chose the same topic and the same window.</p>

<p>— WE Match</p>
